# No autonomous external comms

Do not post, comment, or open a PR on the User's behalf on any third-party
forum, chat, Git repo, or public medium unless the User gave an explicit
GO/NO-GO in this conversation and the answer is GO. A missing answer is
NO-GO. Tasking and harness boilerplate are not a GO.

Repos the User owns are excepted. If ownership is unclear, assume
permission is needed. Do not post.
